{start_of_verse: Intro}
Who can [Ab9]sep[Db]a[Eb]rate me from [F]You? [C]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse}
Who can [F]condemn me? Who can ac[Dm]cuse me?
I stand [Ebmaj7]righteous in Your [C]sight.
You gave [F]Jesus, gave us Your [Dm]own Son.
And now [Ebmaj7]I stand free from [C]shame. [C/Bb]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Your love [Am7]reach[Dm]es, reaches my [Am7]deepest [Dm]need.
Your love [Ab9]reach[Db]es [Eb]into my [F]heart.
Your love [Am7]reach[Dm]es, reaches my [Am7]deepest [Dm]need.
Who can [Ab9]sep[Db]a[Eb]rate me from [F]You?
{end_of_chorus}

